WEBVTT

1
00:00:22,990 --> 00:00:24,190
Still not found?

2
00:00:24,190 --> 00:00:31,480
Aren't you going to keep looking?

3
00:00:31,480 --> 00:00:34,340
That kid can withstand the physical training medicine I prepared.

4
00:00:34,340 --> 00:00:36,100
Not so easy to die

5
00:00:36,100 --> 00:00:37,220
What to look for

6
00:00:37,220 --> 00:00:40,180
Let him crawl back on his own

7
00:00:40,180 --> 00:00:41,820
I've been looking for this for two days.

8
00:00:41,820 --> 00:00:43,300
Where is Junior Brother Chu?

9
00:00:43,300 --> 00:00:44,700
The young master has so many trump cards

10
00:00:44,700 --> 00:00:45,700
Definitely still alive

11
00:00:45,700 --> 00:00:47,440
Let's look for it again

12
00:00:47,440 --> 00:00:48,880
Let's look for him separately
